  turbine:['Turbine trip','The turbine trips. The reactor trips straight after, the steam dumps open and auxiliary feed starts.',[[0,'Turbine trips: steam stops going to the turbine.'],[1,'The reactor trips automatically.'],[6,'Temperature rises: the steam dumps open to get rid of the heat.'],[18,'Steam generator levels shrink. Auxiliary feedwater starts.'],[60,'The plant settles at no-load temperature, 292 °C.']]],
